model outside_read
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.2 (#211, G2, S-1): a balance reading of an outside place of unit any; tally 2.2: LOAD-UNIT (a balance reading of a place of unit any). Twin outside_any_kept (no reading of it)."

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind outs: place any signed outside
place out: outs lives 1900-01-01..
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  anchor out
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  stated[out] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-03-31 end "s"

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
